Let's end this…

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:35.360
I'm… I'm withdrawing from this game.

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.760
I'll be at the entrance.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.990
If you want to live, you should come see me.

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:48.770
With the remaining time, once I'm a sheep I'll run away from the wolf so they can't find me.

00:16:48.770 --> 00:16:50.270
Alice?

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:51.680
It's because…

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:53.950
The only reason I'm standing here today…

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.810
Is because of all of you.

00:16:55.810 --> 00:17:00.690
This life…

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:02.680
wouldn't be worth living if I had to sacrifice all of you.

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:06.950
I've forgotten something so important to me.

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:10.350
I want to withdraw from this game.

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:15.070
That's just like you, Alice.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:20.030
I had just started thinking the very same.

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:23.910
The one who lives shouldn't be me.

00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:27.580
Thank you, Alice, Chouta…

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:30.850
For reminding me of the most important thing…

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:34.600
What's more meaningful than my own life.

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:36.090
Karube…

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:40.500
I'm not going to be seeing you either.

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.730
I'm afraid of dying, but…

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:45.430
If I could die for my friend…

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:47.720
I won't regret it.

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:50.660
I'm proud to hear you say that.

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:53.810
You really grew up into a man, didn't you?

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:58.940
Sorry that I've graduated before you, Alice.

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:02.010
At this rate, I'll…

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.560
Wait… If nobody comes…

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.600
All three of you want to die?

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:07.600
All of you are playing best friends?

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.150
Are you kidding me?

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:14.140
You expect me to live on with the sacrifice
you're all ready to make?

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:16.340
I can't shoulder that burden!

00:18:17.230 --> 00:18:18.850
Shibuki!

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:20.990
What's going on?! Show yourselves!

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:21.950
Come out!

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.620
Come out, damn it!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.010
Alice, would you listen to my parting words?

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.330
You know how we always talked about my dream?

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:39.510
The one where I buy a huge ranch
in Australia and raise some sheep.

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:42.170
That was…

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:45.970
Because you said you wanted
to go to Australia, Alice.

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.640
You might not remember,

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:51.200
but you told me about your dream once.

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:53.350
<i>A reportage writer?!</i>

00:18:53.350 --> 00:18:54.650
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:18:54.650 --> 00:19:00.550
<i>I'd give interviews and put them
in newspaper and magazines.</i>

00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:04.330
Maybe I'll even publish my own travel book.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.540
I'd buy my own camper off of the royalties.

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:12.060
I'd end everyday writing an article,
watching the sunset from a different location.

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:14.750
That's so you.

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:16.880
And where would you travel to?

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:18.480
Let's see…

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.790
Australia?

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:21.840
Yeah.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:25.990
A country with vast plots of land and a pretty sunset would be nice.

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:31.510
When? The day would come where our dreams would be fulfilled.

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:36.350
You would occasionally drop by my ranch in your camper.

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:39.650
I'd have my awesome son take care of the sheep…

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:43.610
And we'd both have a beer in
our hand, reminiscing into the evening.

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:45.130
And that…

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:48.050
To have the both of us see that sunset…

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:51.930
That was my dream.

00:19:54.120 --> 00:19:56.130
It was then…<i></i>

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:58.770
<i>That I was playing Hide and Seek, as the rules stated.</i>

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:00.000
Where?!

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.500
<i>As the wolf that I was…</i>

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:03.970
<i>Looking for every sheep.</i>

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.180
Come out!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:08.070
<i>But none would come out.</i>

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:12.490
<i>They didn't want to come out.</i>
Why can't I find any of you?!

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:12.730
<i>They didn't want to come out.</i>

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:14.330
<i>Desperately…</i>

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:17.620
Please, come out!

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:23.250
What am I supposed to do all alone?!

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:27.700
You were a once-in-a-life-time best friend.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:30.370
Live on for the rest of us.

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:33.470
See ya, Alice!

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:24.070
You want to live?

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.070
I see…

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:47.190
Fuck you!

00:21:47.190 --> 00:21:49.980
Do you fucking enjoy doing all this shit?!

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:51.780
Where are you going?!

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:53.240
I won't forgive you!

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:55.320
I'll never forgive you!

00:21:55.320 --> 00:21:59.930
I'm going to kill all you fuckers who set up these fucking games!

00:22:00.620 --> 00:22:02.310
We'll survive together.

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:27.090
Rofl I am too lazy to cut this shit part Ohys-Raws left it.
Enjoy the useless MBs that take this shit takes up.
